1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,345
Arcadedu is an adaptive learning

2
00:00:02,345 --> 00:00:05,130
system with an autonomous study agent.

3
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:09,527
Studying isn't just about generating more questions.

4
00:00:09,527 --> 00:00:12,943
The hard part is deciding what to study next,

5
00:00:12,943 --> 00:00:16,890
and how that plan should change as progress changes.

6
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:19,743
Every problem the student sees

7
00:00:19,743 --> 00:00:22,066
is generated and graded live.

8
00:00:22,066 --> 00:00:24,790
There's no authored question bank.

9
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:27,998
A student creates a Study Mission:

10
00:00:27,998 --> 00:00:30,432
pick a subject and topics, set

11
00:00:30,432 --> 00:00:33,190
an exam date and a weekly cadence.

12
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:37,078
A short diagnostic seeds a mastery model, and

13
00:00:37,078 --> 00:00:41,050
a deterministic engine lays out the full study plan.

14
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:45,674
As sessions complete, an AI agent can propose a change

15
00:00:45,674 --> 00:00:50,080
to that plan, but it never touches the database directly.

16
00:00:50,530 --> 00:00:52,789
Every proposal passes through

17
00:00:52,789 --> 00:00:55,282
a deterministic validator first.

18
00:00:55,282 --> 00:00:58,710
If the agent is unavailable, the plan simply

19
00:00:58,710 --> 00:01:02,450
holds, and that's logged for the student to see.

20
00:01:02,900 --> 00:01:06,869
The Inbox is the one place the agent surfaces:

21
00:01:06,869 --> 00:01:09,889
a digest, decisions, and reminders.

22
00:01:09,889 --> 00:01:12,650
Never a stream of interruptions.

23
00:01:13,100 --> 00:01:15,720
The agent manages the process.

24
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:18,340
The student does the learning.
